While within 15 meters of an ally, grants the following benefits:
• 50 Handling
• 50 Reload Speed
• 10% decreased Reload Animation Duration

Firing within 15 meters of an ally grants them 'Pack Hunter' for 15 seconds.

Pack Hunter buffs all non-exotic Rocket Launchers and causes them to spawn Wolfpack Rounds on detonation. Wolfpack Rounds deal damage matching the element of the rocket that fired them, and in <bold most /> cases benefit from weapon perks and Empowering buffs.

On average, Wolfpack Rounds are a 26% buff to base Rocket Launcher damage.

